Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,The Court Dominator
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, as Lion Jay launched his powerful attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.76,0:00:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the fans were completely captivated by his passion,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and even his agent had a change of heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This gave Lion Jay and the team a massive boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Both sides were locked in a high-octane battle, separated by just a single bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,With only one second remaining, Lion Jay managed to get a layup off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, that was incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pity; it was so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:01:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is our basketball dream over just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Time expired. No basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay got his final shot off after the buzzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.20,0:01:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, the basket is disallowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of this game is—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for letting me finish this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll leave the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.48,0:01:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who should leave…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Lion Jay is holding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been forcing you to do things you hated, all for my own selfish greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.68,0:02:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I honestly thought it was what was best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I saw how much heart you guys put into the game out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.40,0:02:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally realized…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.36,0:02:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,what a terrible agent I’ve been. All I ever cared about was profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so sorry, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, everything we have right now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,is all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.24,0:02:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Without your support back then, we wouldn’t be where we are today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This team can’t function without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.92,0:02:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,After everything I’ve done, do I really still have the right to lead you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. No one else could ever replace you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be in your care from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lion Jay. I’m already looking forward to our next all-out battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t lose next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The game between Team Wolves and Team Wild Boar is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s see how this plays out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is Wolffy’s debut; let’s cheer him on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they’re checking in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been grinding day and night for so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.40,0:04:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and it’s all for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, go get ’em!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve finally made the roster as a backup! Maybe I’ll even get some real minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch, little goats! I’m gonna show you what all my hard work was for!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay close attention to the movements and characteristics of each player on Team Wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.72,0:05:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She is Yu Tailang, their point guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She is incredibly agile,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and a master of the drive and kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He is Ning Tailang, their shooting guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.76,0:05:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a great long-range shooter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.92,0:06:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Tank, their center.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He is exceptionally tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and his strength is quite astonishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.92,0:06:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Stretch, their power forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He has an excellent vertical,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.32,0:06:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and his rebounding is equally terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the core of Team Wolves,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,their small forward, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.64,0:07:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,His speed, vertical, shooting, strength, and skill
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.68,0:07:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,are all top-notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.84,0:07:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.64,0:07:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When will it be my turn to check in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No. 99, hustle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Towel and water!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Go out there and finish the game for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.05,0:08:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.01,0:08:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s actually putting No. 99 in the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Do you even want to play anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m heading out right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the official debut of my basketball career.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, go get ’em!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:09:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.09,0:09:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you notice? Victor has been looking in our direction the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.01,0:09:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You noticed that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.85,0:09:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.81,0:09:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.93,0:09:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Master and disciple?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard right, Blazey was once Victor’s master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.17,0:09:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, Blazey led Team Goats to the finals of the Basketball Game back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.45,0:09:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,At that time, Victor was still his disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.77,0:10:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,For some unknown reason, they severed their master–disciple relationship from that day on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.09,0:10:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and went their separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazey was also sidelined due to an injury, and the outcome was predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.41,0:10:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The Goat Clan suffered a crushing defeat, and that was when our basketball team began
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,to fall into such a deep decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.85,0:10:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So that’s what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Mr. Slowy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,how do you know all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.81,0:10:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As a professional basketball manager,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,of course, I need to check everyone’s background thoroughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not lose again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go one-on-one again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.77,0:11:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you’re not the No. 42 you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I will prove to you with my game that my basketball is the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.89,0:11:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven’t changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves is absolutely dominant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.45,0:11:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re already up by 40, but Team Wild Boar just won’t give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.05,0:11:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves is playing exceptionally well in this second half!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.65,0:11:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But what impresses me the most is actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, No. 99!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:11:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Although he only has 6 points,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,he has put up an impressive stat line of 9 rebounds and 8 steals!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,—Good job!　—That’s quite an achievement for a debut!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.81,0:12:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, you’re really incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected Wolffy to be so incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right; we can’t afford to slack off either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it time for dinner yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.33,0:12:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations to Team Wolves for winning this game!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
